{"plan_objective_id": 1, "updated_plan_objective_json": "{
  "id": 1,
  "objective": "Research Adam T. Clare's multi-laser/multi-beam PBF work",
  "rationale": "Extensive evidence gathered. Note: The main multi-laser work found is from University of Sheffield (Mumtaz, Groom, Alsaddah, Caglar, Aydin, Erman) rather than directly Clare at Nottingham. Clare has an AM patent and some LPBF work but the multi-laser diode array work is primarily Sheffield DAM/DPM/DLAH. The hybrid multi-laser thesis by Caglar bridges both groups.",
